WEBVTT

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:35.040
Will you stop bullying my brother?

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:45.810
Jyuusan-hime...

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:56.220
You there. It sounds like you've said what you wanted to say to my brother.

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.220
Would you mind leaving now?

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.140
The two of us have a lot to talk about as well.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:07.980
Indeed, I've said what I wanted to say.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.400
Please, excuse me.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:20.410
Apparently, you haven't told that prince yet.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.690
That I've been instructed either to enter the Imperial Residence, or to marry Shi Seiran,

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:26.680
whichever I prefer.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.040
I won't even consider the latter.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.430
Oh? May I ask why?

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:37.070
I don't think you'd be at all happy if you married Seiran.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.110
Besides...

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:43.490
I don't want him as my younger brother.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:46.530
Ryuuren is enough to make my life a joke.

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:49.310
Imagine what would happen if Seiran became my brother.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.770
You've become more talkative.

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:55.090
I wonder if you're happier these days.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:59.060
I am. Thanks, Jyuusan-hime.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.060
I didn't believe that you'd come here.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:07.770
But when you thought about it, didn't you realize I'd make a perfect wife for the Emperor?

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:11.580
Yes, perhaps too perfect a wife for the Emperor.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:16.970
You'd probably understand His Highness's feelings better than anyone else.

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:20.630
Our older brothers show no mercy, do they?

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.760
You're hopeless, brother.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.850
You're so naive.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:30.700
You knew one of your sisters would
show up sooner or later, didn't you?

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:33.200
Even so, you "accidentally" accepted an iris...

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.250
and reciprocated the Emperor's love.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.180
Shuuei-nii-sama is a direct descendant of the Ran family.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:43.210
There's no way you could've sworn true loyalty to the Emperor.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:48.250
I pity the Emperor...

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:52.370
but it will be even more pitiful if you drag out this relationship.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.040
Could Shuuei-nii-sama abandon the Ran family?

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.240
No.

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:02.550
If you take away the Ran name, then I have nothing left.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:06.050
Seriously, you're such a hopeless brother.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:10.570
But I know that in the end, you'll make a choice.

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:12.560
After all, you're a man of the Ran family.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:15.220
You've still got time.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:20.120
Until the last moment, use your time, and me, to think it through.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.620
I don't think you're that stupid.

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:26.950
Though that ex-prince might think so.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:29.700
Seiran was always like that.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:35.020
Brother, there's an easier way out,
where you wouldn't have to suffer anymore.

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.840
Just kill me.

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:42.580
Do that, and this deal goes up in smoke.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:49.340
Don't underestimate me. I wouldn't do that.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.980
I thought so. That's why you suffer so much.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:01.060
That means you didn't send those assassins after me?

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:04.780
No.

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:11.190
Something is going on here too,
concerning that gang of assassins.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:15.810
The plan is to keep you hidden in an annex of the Imperial Residence.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:20.040
The Vice Minister of Arms has arranged matters for you.

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.270
I got it.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:24.550
The princess of the Kou family will be coming along as well, won't she?

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.110
I think so.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:30.300
That's even more reason why you should stay beside her.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.590
Shuurei-dono is probably in danger too.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.320
Thank you for coming by.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:47.570
Today, I'm going to inspect the hygiene standards and facilities of this prison.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:54.870
Also, once and for all, I'll drag out - I mean - release that condemned convict who was proven innocent.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.000
Will he come out?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:00.130
We've come here so many times,
but he's never left his cell, has he?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.630
Well, ever since Inspector Kou took charge of this prison,

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:09.470
the work environment and hygiene standards have improved a lot.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.230
We're truly grateful.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:16.020
You're the first government official since Inspector Riku

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.600
who pays regular visits to inspect the prison.

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.390
Inspector Riku...

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:25.740
Inspector Riku was also very young, but he was a brilliant civil servant.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:27.860
Is he still active in the government?

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:35.120
Yes, he's performed outstanding services for the central government.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.910
Indeed, as expected of him.

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:42.690
"Damn it" is what's written on your face.

00:06:44.910 --> 00:06:46.130
Oujo-chan,

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:49.470
that kind of expression is rather cute too.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:53.100
Shun-san, I'm telling you for the last time to leave.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:57.100
Please stop hanging around this place and cadging free meals.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.940
You've already been exonerated.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:07.190
Thanks to you, this prison has became a rather comfortable place to live, so I've lost interest in leaving.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.040
Don't make jokes.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.950
These are not free lodging accommodations.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.520
Hey, couldn't you be a little nicer to me?

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:20.820
I won't be nice to a person who won't work even though he can, and who stays in prison for the free food.

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:23.160
If you aren't nicer to me, I won't leave.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:29.580
It's great outside the prison! The season is early summer.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:32.990
Maybe you'll have a romantic encounter with girls in summer clothes!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.180
Rather than wanting to meet other girls,

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.530
I've stayed here because you visit me, yet you treat me like this?

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:39.980
How painful.

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:46.880
Oh yes, sure, whatever, I'd also love to see you, but not through prison bars.

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:56.740
So in this prison full of men, any flower seems beautiful, huh?

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.820
Hey, Tan-tan!

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:01.560
If you're too honest and say everything that crosses your mind,

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.750
you won't be able to gain the trust of a woman that you love seriously.

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:09.000
Please don't sound so sincere when you aren't even trying to comfort him.

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:14.510
What is it?

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:20.000
It's true that I've stayed here because I looked forward to seeing you.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.230
You look like a woman I fell in love with.

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:25.850
"You looked forward to," which means...

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.680
I'm leaving this prison.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:31.230
I don't feel bad when you tell me off,

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:33.990
but I don't want you to hate me.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.260
What made you change your mind?

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.870
Nothing really.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:47.130
As a civil servant, I am truly sorry about the false accusation made against you.

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:48.960
Why are you apologizing?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.880
It's not like <i>you</i> sent me to prison.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:57.270
Shun-san, if you're innocent, you should say so!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:02.890
There's nothing cool about keeping quiet until you're on the verge of a death sentence!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.910
Seriously, you two are alike.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:06.370
Huh?

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:07.620
Nothing.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.500
Well, in return for you releasing me from prison...

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.070
Wh-What?

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.780
Watch out for the ghosts of the prison dead.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.610
"The ghosts of the prison dead"?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.790
Apparently, the rumor about "the ghosts of the prison dead" is quite widespread.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:32.630
I've heard officials from other provinces gossiping about it.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.730
They claimed to have seen the ghosts of the prison dead,

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:39.300
but how do people know that the ghosts came from the prison?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:43.060
What? Did an idea flash through your mind?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.020
Yes, it did!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.770
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.370
Damn it!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.770
Who are those guys?!

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:57.950
How should I know?!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.950
They're obviously after you!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.200
Like I said, I don't know!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:05.500
There!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.060
What on earth?

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.470
A smoke bomb, specially made by Rin-san!

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:13.150
Never mind that, keep running!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.640
What on earth is going on?

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:26.270
This is the first time in my life that
I've been targeted for assassination.

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.390
Honestly...

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:32.940
Seiga.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.860
I don't feel like looking at your face right now.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.860
Please, go somewhere else.

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:40.830
What a nice greeting.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:43.440
Look at you, coming back in such a state.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.120
What happened?

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:48.120
Why are you here?

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.630
Jyuusan-hime has arrived.

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:56.220
We're getting things ready.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.630
As soon as preparations are complete, you'll move into the Imperial Residence.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.420
Of course, it's strictly confidential that Jyuusan-hime and you are there.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:06.460
To enter the Imperial Residence... again...

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.990
Does it have to be the Imperial Residence?

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:12.050
Aren't you content?

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:14.710
Sure, the security is strict there,

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.170
but it's also the place with the highest rate of assassinations and suspicious deaths.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.510
That's why.

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:24.490
We don't want the security to be so tight that the assassins can't enter.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:27.160
The security there is reasonably lax. It's perfect.

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:29.890
So I'm bait?

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.630
You're just a double. Nobody will be bothered if you die.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.250
Fine.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:40.120
Do your work for the Section of Government Inspection at the Imperial Residence.

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:43.010
You'll be living in the Imperial Residence for a while.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.530
How long is "a while" supposed to be?!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:49.940
Until the person who's plotting the
assassination is discovered, or alternatively,

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:54.270
until Jyuusan-hime officially becomes the wife of the Emperor.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.470
I understand.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:57.680
That's all.

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:10.790
Hey, I don't really understand, but don't fret too much, okay?

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:18.670
Tan-tan, this is supposed to be my job too, but there's nothing left for me to do.

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.040
That's good.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:21.670
What?

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:26.930
"The others have done the work, yay!" At least try to think of it that way.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.220
You're only eighteen, you know.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:30.780
Just two years into civil service.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:34.940
It's impossible to do as well as Seiga-kun.

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:38.190
Even he needed six years to become who he is today.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:41.500
There's nothing shameful in getting help from others, is there?

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:46.700
"My cool senior has helped me. Sweet!" Take it like that.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:51.600
Sure, if it <i>was</i> a cool senior, I'd be happy,

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:53.500
but it's Seiga instead.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.310
Then what if it was me?

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:57.280
I'd simply be happy.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:13:00.270
Then, think of me as your cool senior.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:04.760
For once, you don't have to do the heavy lifting.

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:07.970
Aren't you happy that you have extra time to do other things?

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:10.890
True.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:14.770
You're right! Thanks, Tan-tan!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.740
You regain your footing way too fast.

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:18.450
There's nothing bad about that.

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:21.190
Right, we'll work hard, Tan-tan!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.300
No, I'm going to sleep.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.730
I have the data on the number of condemned criminals

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:29.240
and the number of deaths in the prison, like you asked.

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:32.370
So, good night.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.000
Good night.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:45.360
It's definitely a little odd.

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:48.810
The number of condemned criminals that have died depends on the prison...

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:52.500
Is this also true in other provinces besides Shi?

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:56.130
That one on the top shelf... Is that it?

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.540
Umm... Where's the footstool?

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:00.300
What are you doing?

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:00.790
Oh!

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.770
You want to get a book out?

00:14:03.040 --> 00:14:06.480
Riou-kun, you shouldn't barge into the Section of Government Inspection!

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:09.530
The Secretary of Mystic Study can enter this section at any time.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.740
My position outranks Ki Kouki.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.410
You're right, come to think of it.

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:19.540
So, which one do you want me to get?

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.540
Here you go.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.550
Thank you.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:28.550
Did you want to talk to me about something?

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:30.490
Would you like to have a cup of tea?

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.200
I can make tea myself.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.050
If you continually cater to men,

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.580
they'll get used to it and start taking advantage of you, you know.

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.910
Learn to let others do things for you.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:44.330
What a difference compared to Seiga.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:48.570
I wonder if I could infuse his character into Seiga somehow?

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:51.070
You're so kind, Riou-kun.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:55.010
It's normal in our family.

00:14:55.010 --> 00:14:57.410
You're the unusual one.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.420
Would you listen if I played the erhu?

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:05.440
Don't you have work to do?

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:08.970
It would be a nice change of pace to play a piece,

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.180
but only if you want to listen.

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:30.700
I might have said something that upset the Emperor.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:32.430
To Ryuuki?

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:37.840
I didn't lie to him, but I think I said too much.

00:15:38.390 --> 00:15:40.280
He might be crying now.

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:43.170
Shu-su-i...

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:47.670
Ryuuki-sama, an Emperor mustn't whimper.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:50.170
Embroidery... Let's do some embroidery.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:54.130
I've decided to do embroidery and distract myself!

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:55.970
Please keep me company.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.680
Embroidery... Shusui...

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:07.440
Very well, I will keep you company.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.190
Did you apologize to Ryuuki directly?

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.350
No.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:15.220
Then you should.

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:19.720
Ryuuki's kind. So if you apologize to him, he'll forgive you.

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:22.080
Besides, Ryuuki likes you.

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:24.440
Likes?

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:25.630
He likes me?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.830
Yes.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:30.380
Ryuuki's really obvious when he likes someone.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:33.010
You even think, "Wow, hold on!"

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:43.340
Oh, in a few days time, we'll be accommodating

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:46.270
Jyuusan-hime and Shuurei-sama in the annex of the Imperial Residence.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:48.520
I'll be going over there too.

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:52.280
Yeah, please take care of them.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:54.820
Are you unhappy?

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.350
They're both coming at the same time!

00:16:57.350 --> 00:17:00.120
Should I be happy or not?

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:02.830
I don't even know how to react to this.

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:08.300
Shusui, you're not planning to get married soon, are you?

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:10.340
Why are you asking that, out of the blue?

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:16.680
If even Shusui were to disappear, I'd cry for real.

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:20.540
Your Highness...

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:25.850
I wish to stay by your side for as long as possible.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.350
I truly mean that.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.410
Shusui...

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:34.880
However, the day might come when I have to leave your side.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:39.830
Wh-Why? Are you really going to get married?

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:48.920
I've run away from many things and
always had someone to protect me.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.700
I've run and run.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:56.130
It was only a matter of time before a day like this would come.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.450
Shusui...

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.910
Oh! Please, don't worry about it for now.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:05.470
I should be able to stay by your side for a while.

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:08.900
I couldn't possibly leave Your Highness in the state you're in right now.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:13.400
F-Fine, if you say so.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:19.410
He likes me, huh?

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:21.990
Thanks for your time.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.200
Oh, you're going?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.150
Yeah.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:33.800
I don't dislike how you play the erhu.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:35.800
Well, thank you.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:36.810
See ya.

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:41.380
Obey my order...

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.370
The task...

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:46.310
Obey my order...

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.710
The task...

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.150
Obey my order...

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.980
The task...

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.770
No, not yet.

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:01.450
I said I wouldn't leave his side yet. I promised.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:05.170
I'm impressed how well you're able to resist.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:11.330
I never thought my eyes were the trigger to put you in a hypnotic trance.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.040
Where's your room? I'll walk you th-

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.420
No! Don't come near me.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:19.160
Is it just me who thinks you're really prejudiced against me?

00:19:19.160 --> 00:19:20.550
I guess it can't be helped.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.420
Leave her alone, right there.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:23.050
What?

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.020
Shouka-sama...

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:42.820
Huh?

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:45.430
Please go.

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:49.210
Please... leave...

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:00.560
Brother, I'm coming in.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:10.180
That's not the kind of fan Gyokuka-nee-sama would have.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.370
That's because it's not hers.

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.290
Oh, it's not?

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.310
Why did your voice just go up an octave?

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:20.700
It's not like she's my lover or anything.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:23.790
She's madly in love with another man.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:26.650
She mistook me for him earlier.

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:31.160
Is she a court lady of the Imperial Residence?

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:34.230
Exactly. She's the chief court lady.

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:36.370
You'll probably be under her care.

00:20:36.890 --> 00:20:39.170
So, what do you want from me?

00:20:40.060 --> 00:20:42.950
You went to look at the annex, right?

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:43.890
How was it?

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:45.180
Did it look good?

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:50.520
It was neat, but it would be easier to protect you at our place.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:55.300
However, I don't want Section of Government Inspection using the opportunity to investigate our residence.

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:57.190
Besides, should anything happen at the annex of the Imperial Residence,

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:59.770
we can blame the Section of Government Inspection for it.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:03.350
Oh, you sound so cool, just like a man of the Ran family.

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:07.450
Brother, you have no intention of
protecting me or Shuurei-san, do you?

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:13.600
Even if I don't protect the two of you,
you'll just do your best on your own, won't you?

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:16.350
You're such a loser.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.840
Fine, I'll sort it out somehow.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.590
I'm a man of the Ran family. I can't become anyone else.

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:25.900
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:29.300
You've nothing to gain by pretending to be cool in front of your sister, you know.

00:21:30.920 --> 00:21:33.000
You still have time.

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.720
I'm glad you were the one who came here.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:49.570
Jyuusan-hime, tell the Emperor that the next time he sees me will be the last.

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:52.080
I got it.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:54.890
And just one more thing...

00:22:04.930 --> 00:22:07.240
So you'll be living in the Imperial Residence starting today.

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.340
I'm not going there because I want to.

00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:11.850
Why not? You can sit back and relax there for now.

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:14.120
How can I sit back and relax?

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:16.100
Shuurei-sama!

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:19.690
Seiran! Shusui!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.980
Long time, no see, Shuurei-sama.

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:24.230
Shusui!

00:22:24.600 --> 00:22:26.770
It's been ages. How are you?

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:28.110
What's wrong?

00:22:28.470 --> 00:22:30.310
Have you lost weight?

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:32.270
Have I?

00:22:32.270 --> 00:22:34.120
I'm perfectly fine.

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.440
You're sure?

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:40.880
Let's order some incense to help you relax later.

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:41.980
Okay.

00:22:41.980 --> 00:22:43.130
Seiran.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:47.290
We've been waiting for you, oujo-sama and Tan-tan-kun.

00:22:47.290 --> 00:22:49.910
We received a message from the Section of Government Inspection.

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:50.890
This way please.

00:22:53.990 --> 00:22:57.580
When you say "an annex of the Imperial Residence," do you mean Tousen Court?

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:58.890
That's right.

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:03.080
Jyuusan-hime has already arrived.

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:12.650
Oh?

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:13.910
It's the girl...

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:18.500
From back then?!

00:23:19.260 --> 00:23:22.180
This isn't the first time we've met, is it?

00:23:22.180 --> 00:23:23.650
Kou Shuurei-san.

00:24:44.960 --> 00:24:49.750
Jyuusan-hime... Should I say she's manly or tomboyish? She's just energetic.

00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:52.510
I sense similarities between the two of us.

00:24:52.510 --> 00:24:56.220
We're the same height, our faces look alike, and our breast sizes are...
